{command} <question> | reset
Ask the AI anything. Powered by Groq, with a friendly and slightly mischievous personality.
*/ <question>
Ask the AI anything. The language of your message is detected automatically and the answer comes back in the same language.
*/ reset
Clear your conversation history with the AI.
*/aiset
AI admin settings. See the aiset help for the full list of subcommands.
Language detection
The AI detects the language of your message automatically and replies in the same language.
Room context
In a room, the AI also sees the recent room messages as context.
Rate limits
Each user has a history limit of 40 messages by default. Clear it with 'ai reset'.
Ollama has been removed, the provider is now fixed to Groq.
